{
    "background_story": "Kenneth was a master woodworker with a passion for creating beautiful pieces from the finest ebony wood. Growing up in a family of skilled craftsmen, he learned the art of woodworking from a young age. Kenneth's fascination with ebony began when he stumbled upon an old, intricately carved ebony box in his grandfather's attic. The box's dark, glossy surface seemed to hold secrets and stories of its own. Inspired, Kenneth dedicated himself to mastering the art of working with ebony. His creations, from elegant furniture to delicate jewelry boxes, were highly sought after by collectors and connoisseurs. Kenneth's love for ebony was not just about its beauty, but also about the rich history and cultural significance it held. He believed that every piece of ebony held a story, and he was determined to bring those stories to life through his craft.",
